Third-Party Data Notice:
The Telco Customer Churn dataset referenced by this project is hosted within an IBM
open-source code pattern repository (IBM/telco-customer-churn-on-icp4d), where repository
code is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. However, the repository hosts
the CSV as a sample asset without a dedicated open-data license (e.g., CDLA, CC-BY, ODbL).
Redistribution rights cannot be conclusively established from upstream metadata alone.
Accordingly, PredictLab distinguishes its MIT software license from third-party dataset
terms, documents this provenance limitation, and provides an automated download and
integrity verification procedure in data/README.md.
